# Secrets for running the Cloudflare version on your own machine (`pnpm cf:dev`).
# Copy this file to apps/api/.dev.vars and replace the value. .dev.vars is git-ignored: never commit it.
# Cloudflare deployment uses Worker secrets through the token helper (see README.md#cloudflare).
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string-of-at-least-32-characters
# `pnpm cf:dev` uses the local R2 simulator, without Tigris credentials or a payment card.
# To test real Tigris privately, configure these as local secrets (never commit real values):
# TIGRIS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-access-key-id
# TIGRIS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret-access-key
